        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were ocerino Yesu me kwoŋ jom'otho; aka wajoje wabedo jokony i wac me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otiek tiŋo go malo yuracuc pa Were aka onyo walimo bonge Cuny Maleŋ paka Bamere ociko; aka gim'onyo pama wineno aka odoko wiwinjo me, obedo mic pere ma go okonjo kwoŋ wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 110:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Daudi won k'okidho malo i polo, to owaco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo ji ma Isiraili, joripo ŋeyo adieri ni manago Yesu, ma wiguro kwoŋ musalaba, ama Were oloko Rwoth kodi Kristo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jowinjo gime, cuny jo oramo jo swa, to jopenjo Petero kodi jomoor man ni, “Wutmin wan wanotim aŋo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero odwoko jo ni, “Ŋuti win reco mewin, obatisa win i nyingi Yesu Kristo, wocwaki reco mewin, aka wibino limo mic ma Cuny Maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole cikirok me obedo riwin kodi nyithindho mewin kodi ji je ma jonitie bor, ji je ma Were lwoŋo bonge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero oluwo rijo aka oruma jo gi wac man madit munyo medo jo miseni ni, “Bothi win kwoŋ ndir ma pama m'opoŋ gi reco me!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno ji mathoth ma joyeyo mikwenda pere obatisa jo; ji ma romo gana adek jomedere i kweth pajo i ndelo no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jocwire kwoŋ fonji pa jomoor munyo jobedo i kweth acel, i cemo kodi i kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lworo opoŋ i cuny kisi dhano, aka jomoor jotimo gir'aura kodi ranyuth madit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.4.32+ACT.4.33+ACT.4.34+ACT.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 4:32-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jom'oyeyo je jobedo kanyacel aka jotimo gimoro je kanyacel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jotana gigipiny kodi lim pajo, to jopoko gim'owok'iye i dier gin paka kisi dhano oyenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bin kisi ndelo jokidho romo kanyacel i Ot pa Were, odoko jocemo kanyacel i udi pajo gi kisangala kodi cuny jo maber, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "munyo jopako Were aka ji je oyido jofoyo jo. Ameno Rwoth omedo welo pajo gi jom'oyido ibotho jo kisi ndelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
